 Release notes are listed newest first. English is followed by Simplified Chinese.
 Test releases are experimental and do not establish real-vehicle compatibility.
 
+## [v0.1.28-test.1] - 2026-11-25
+
+> R41 — projected appearance and media lifecycle candidate.
+
+### English
+- Follow the phone's system light/dark configuration, with clock fallback only when unavailable.
+- Unregister departed media sessions and invalidate old artwork requests on disconnect or selection changes.
+- Bound artwork transfer, decode size and queued requests; retain readable UI and existing video pacing.
+
+### 简体中文
+- 车机玻璃主题跟随手机系统浅色／深色配置，仅在无法读取时使用本地时钟兜底。
+- 注销已退出媒体会话的回调，断开或切换歌曲时使旧封面请求失效。
+- 限制封面传输、解码尺寸和排队请求，保留清晰界面和原有视频调度。
+
 ## [v0.1.27-test.1] - 2026-11-25
 
 > R40 — media-aware projected shell candidate; real-vehicle validation pending.
